# Optional server-only setting. Unset uses info.
# Supported values: debug, info, warn, error, silent.
# Empty/unknown values are invalid; uncomment and fill deliberately.
# LOG_LEVEL=
# Optional DATABASE_URL: unset resolves to private data/vn30.sqlite in this project.
# Overrides require file: followed by an absolute private local path; see README.
# DATABASE_URL=
# No provider key or broker credential is required.

# Optional server-only normalized local current-source dataset (no synthetic fallback).
# Must conform to src/shared/validation/current-source.ts; never submitted by browser.
# VN30_CURRENT_SOURCE_FILE=/absolute/private/path/current-source.json

# Optional private broker snapshot for viewing imported holdings/cash before ledger onboarding.
# Preserves separate observation dates; never authorizes trades or supplies current valuation.
# VN30_BROKER_SNAPSHOT_FILE=/absolute/private/path/active-snapshot.json
